# Play test of Crowncrag Ruin (CIPlay crowncrag_ruin, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: up the path to the castle
# court, the lookout's ladder and chest, the cellar hatch, the cottage's box, the north cave's chest, the rats and the
# screecher. Points as in its recipe.
island Crowncrag Ruin
offset 0 0
expect animals Rat 3
expect animals Screecher 1
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Turtle 2
wait 3
kill Rat
kill Screecher
# From the village up the path, through the gate into the court
walk 1 -15 to 4.5 -12 to 8 -9 to 10 -4 to 10 2 h=10
# Up the lookout's ladder, its chest
climb 7.75 7.8 h=10
expect stand 7.75 8.75 h=12.52 below=14
open Chest on the lookout
# The cellar hatch
use cellarhatch
open Under the hatch
# Into the middle cottage, its box
walk -12 -14 to -12 -12 to -12 -10 h=3.6 below=5
open Cottager's box
# Into the north cave
walk -13 44 to -13 38 to -13 33 h=2.1 below=3
open Chest in the north cave
dig
